rIW hrt-text hrt-font-body-bold hrt-text-positive hrt-text-uppercase hrt-text-body-md">1st donor</span></div></div><div class="donation-overview_footerContainer__w67U_"></div></div></div><div class="divider_divider__omN05 hrt-mt-0 hrt-mb-0 hrt-rule hrt-rule--horizontal"></div></div><div class="p-campaign-byline hrt-hide-max-md campaign-page_printHidden__yimHj"><div class="hrt-hide-max-md"><div class="m-campaign-byline"><div class="hrt-align-center hrt-disp-flex"><div class="hrt-position-relative hrt-mr-2"><button class="campaign-byline_avatarButton__OZdAb hrt-base-button" type="button" aria-label="Scroll to organizers"><div class="hrt-image-avatar hrt-avatar hrt-avatar--small hrt-avatar--neutral campaign-byline_heroMediaAvatar__UW0CP"><img alt="Profile photo of JoAnna Bosford" height="24" src="https://images.gofundme.com/jq3VIT5pwgrhzxG99SiiefisShk=/128x128/https://gofundme.com/person/profiles/6c5b5434-7cb1-47bf-b5e1-a5ec32de8713/6c5b5434-7cb1-47bf-b5e1-a5ec32de8713.jpg" width="24"></div></button></div><div class="m-campaign-byline-description"><button class="hrt-no-underline hrt-text-left hrt-disp-inline campaign-byline_textButton___NfBw hrt-text-button hrt-text-button--gray-dark hrt-text-button--underlined" data-tracking-id="campaign byline: scroll to organizers" tabindex="0"><strong>JoAnna Bosford</strong></button></div></div></div></div><div class="hrt-hide-min-md"><div class="m-campaign-byline"><div class="hrt-align-center hrt-disp-flex"><ul class="hrt-list-unstyled hrt-avatar-stack hrt-avatar-stack--horizontal hrt-mr-2"><li class="hrt-avatar-stack-item hrt-avatar-stack-item--0" style="z-index:1"><div class="hrt-image-avatar hrt-avatar hrt-avatar--large hrt-avatar--neutral hrt-avatar--surface-default"><img alt="Profile photo of JoAnna Bosford" height="40" src="https://images.gofundme.com/jq3VIT5pwgrhzxG99SiiefisShk=/128x128/https://gofundme.com/person/profiles/6c5b5434-7cb1-47bf-b5e1-a5ec32de8713/6c5b5434-7cb1-47bf-b5e1-a5ec32de8713.jpg" width="40"></div></li></ul><div class="m-campaign-byline-description">JoAnna Bosford is organizing this fundraiser.</div></div></div></div></div><div class="p-campaign-byline campaign-page_printOnly__DTAyG"><div class="m-campaign-byline"><div class="hrt-align-center hrt-disp-flex"><div class="hrt-position-relative hrt-mr-2"><button class="campaign-byline_avatarButton__OZdAb hrt-base-button" type="button" aria-label="Scroll to organizers"><div class="hrt-image-avatar hrt-avatar hrt-avatar--small hrt-avatar--neutral campaign-byline_heroMediaAvatar__UW0CP"><img alt="Profile photo of JoAnna Bosford" height="24" src="https://images.gofundme.com/jq3VIT5pwgrhzxG99SiiefisShk=/128x128/https://gofundme.com/person/profiles/6c5b5434-7cb1-47bf-b5e1-a5ec32de8713/6c5b5434-7cb1-47bf-b5e1-a5ec32de8713.jpg" width="24"></div></button></div><div class="m-campaign-byline-description"><button class="hrt-no-underline hrt-text-left hrt-disp-inline campaign-byline_textButton___NfBw hrt-text-button hrt-text-button--gray-dark hrt-text-button--underlined" data-tracking-id="campaign byline: scroll to organizers" tabindex="0"><strong>JoAnna Bosford</strong></button></div></div></div></div><div class="p-campaign-description"><div class="divider_divider__omN05 hrt-mt-0 hrt-mb-0 hrt-hide-max-md hrt-rule hrt-rule--horizontal"></div><div class="hrt-hide-max-md"><div class="campaign-page_printHidden__yimHj"><div class="hrt-py-2 hrt-disp-flex hrt-align-center"><span class="hrt-tag hrt-tag--accent-blue hrt-base-tag hrt-base-tag--default" data-tracking-id="donation protected pill" style="cursor:pointer"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="hrt-icon hrt-icon--small" focusable="false" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="16"><use href="/_next/static/images/core-16-31932264881037ffb159f5662c201e59c85112cd30a19ba18847913bfef4d15a.svg#gofundme-giving-guarantee"></use></svg>Donation protected</span></div></div></div><div class="hrt-hide-min-md"></div><div class="divider_divider__omN05 hrt-mt-0 hrt-mb-0 hrt-hide-max-md hrt-rule hrt-rule--horizontal"></div><div class="campaign-description_campaignDescription__6P_RU"><div class="campaign-description_content__C1C_5 hrt-mt-3 campaign-description_isOpen__4cQeG" data-testid="campaign-description" style=""><div>My name is JoAnna. I am a victim of domestic violence from my stepdad. He was the person with a vehicle that I had access to because both of my parents have passed away. I was able to move away from his abuse. Since then, I have not been able to reliably get to places I need like doctor appointments because I moved to a small town that is not close to anything within walking distance. Medicabs are unreliable. Most of the time, they either don't show up or show up late and I've missed my appointments. I am currently on SSI due to some mental and physical limitations, like PTSD, anxiety, dextroscoliosis and degenerative disc disease. My goal to achieve my freedom is getting a vehicle of my own. Then, I'll be able to go back to my delivery job and hopefully get off SSI. Being that SSI pays so little, it has made it impossible for me to be able to afford a down payment for a vehicle. I'm desperate for help to gain my freedom and go back to work so I can live more comfortably with my dogs and my cats (that I took in when my mom passed away). I've tried asking for help for a cosigner from my aunts and brother but they've completely ignored me despite me being there for them when they needed it and I have no other family to ask.
</div></div></div><div class="campaign-page_printHidden__yimHj"></div></div><div class="p-campaign-content"><div class="hrt-pb-4 donation-suggestion-card_card__WNQJD"><div class="donation-suggestion-card_banner__Dsqqm upsell-banner_banner__0lR6u" data-testid="donation-suggestion-card"><h2 class="hrt-text-heading-lg hrt-mb-0">Give $20 and be a founding donor</h2><p class="hrt-mb-0 hrt-mt-half">Your donation starts JoAnna’s journey to success by inspiring others to help.</p><a class="hrt-mt-2 hrt-button hrt-button--hierarchy-primary hrt-button--layout-inline hrt-button--size-large hrt-button--color-on-accent-purple hrt-base-button" data-element-id="empty_state_card" href="https://www.gofundme.com/f/help-joanna-gain-freedom-with-reliable-transportation/donate?utm_id=97758_v0_s00_e0_tv4_a1demoo54svanw&amp;fbclid=IwY2xjawUuGO9leHRuA2FlbQIxMABwZG9mBXNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR6LJhlbRPXSiZbaRQ_S5aZAxsPWUmhXE72C7ale1a2JPa2y4V_CAdMTisGIVA_aem_8WYm4OdJIkhbonprZYd9vw&amp;source=btn_empty_state_card_donate&amp;amt=20" data-analytic-event-listener="true"><span>Donate</span></a></div></div><div><div><section class="campaign-section_section__ggZDd asset-sharing_printHidden__KYpxt"><div class="divider_divider__omN05 hrt-mt-0 hrt-mb-0 hrt-mt-2 hrt-mb-2 hrt-rule hrt-rule--horizontal"></div><div class="campaign-section_content__3_Czv"><h2 class="hrt-text hrt-text-default hrt-text-heading-lg">Sharing helps more than you think</h2><p class="hrt-text hrt-text-default hrt-text-body-md">On average, <strong>each share can inspire $50</strong> in donations by helping this fundraiser reach more people.</p><div class="hrt-gap-4 hrt-p-5 hrt-disp-flex hrt-flex-dir-column hrt-surface-neutral-subtle hrt-rounded-5"><div class="hrt-position-relative"><img alt="Preview" class="hrt-rounded-3" data-masking="exclude" src="https://sharing.gofundme.com/c/f/help-joanna-gain-freedom-with-reliable-transportation/fb/s"></div><div class="hrt-disp-flex hrt-align-center hrt-justify-center hrt-gap-2"