ed" href="https://www.gofundme.com/discover/community-fundraiser">Community</a></li><li class="hrt-meta-list-item"><div class="hrt-hide-min-md campaign-page_printHidden__yimHj"><span class="hrt-tag hrt-tag--accent-blue hrt-base-tag hrt-base-tag--default" data-tracking-id="donation protected pill" style="cursor:pointer"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="hrt-icon hrt-icon--small" focusable="false" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="16"><use href="/_next/static/images/core-16-31932264881037ffb159f5662c201e59c85112cd30a19ba18847913bfef4d15a.svg#gofundme-giving-guarantee"></use></svg>Donation protected</span></div></li></ul><div class="divider_divider__omN05 hrt-mt-0 hrt-mb-0 hrt-rule hrt-rule--horizontal"></div></div></div><div class="p-campaign-report-button"><a class="hrt-px-1 hrt-gap-half hrt-button hrt-button--hierarchy-tertiary hrt-button--layout-inline hrt-button--size-medium hrt-button--color-default hrt-base-button" data-element-id="btn_report" href="https://support.gofundme.com/hc/en-us/articles/203604694" data-analytic-event-listener="true"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="hrt-icon hrt-icon--default" focusable="false" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24"><use href="/_next/static/images/core-a1931ce288678834629d0cbab7a1e1264892b61692ec3c93b5f003ec36942c24.svg#flag"></use></svg>Report fundraiser</a></div></div></div></main><div><section class="brand-value-propositions_brandValuePropositions__ZcSfv campaign-page_valueProposition__u_sxv hrt-section hrt-surface-neutral-subtle"><div class="hrt-container"><h2 class="hrt-text-heading-sm hrt-mb-6">Your easy, powerful, and trusted home for help</h2><ul class="hrt-grid-columns hrt-grid-columns--3 hrt-grid-columns--desktop-only hrt-list-unstyled hrt-grid-columns--column-gap-3 hrt-grid-columns--row-gap-4"><li><div class="hrt-value-prop hrt-disp-flex"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="hrt-mr-2 hrt-icon hrt-icon--large" focusable="false" height="48" viewBox="0 0 48 48" width="48"><use href="/_next/static/images/feature-48-f7c4be2e744205fa39ee7ebdabe087b535ec37cfcc0572c652728c0bfcef215d.svg#send-help-in-seconds"></use></svg><div><h3 class="hrt-value-prop-title hrt-text-body-md hrt-font-bold hrt-mb-0">Easy</h3><p class="hrt-value-prop-description">Donate quickly and easily</p></div></div></li><li><div class="hrt-value-prop hrt-disp-flex"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="hrt-mr-2 hrt-icon hrt-icon--large" focusable="false" height="48" viewBox="0 0 48 48" width="48"><use href="/_next/static/images/feature-48-f7c4be2e744205fa39ee7ebdabe087b535ec37cfcc0572c652728c0bfcef215d.svg#powerful"></use></svg><div><h3 class="hrt-value-prop-title hrt-text-body-md hrt-font-bold hrt-mb-0">Powerful</h3><p class="hrt-value-prop-description">Send help right to the people and causes you care about</p></div></div></li><li><div class="hrt-value-prop hrt-disp-flex"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="hrt-mr-2 hrt-icon hrt-icon--large" focusable="false" height="48" viewBox="0 0 48 48" width="48"><use href="/_next/static/images/feature-48-f7c4be2e744205fa39ee7ebdabe087b535ec37cfcc0572c652728c0bfcef215d.svg#gofundme-guarantee"></use></svg><div><h3 class="hrt-value-prop-title hrt-text-body-md hrt-font-bold hrt-mb-0">Trusted</h3><p class="hrt-value-prop-description">Your donation is protected by the <a class="hrt-link hrt-link--gray-dark hrt-link--underlined" href="https://www.gofundme.com/c/safety/gofundme-guarantee" rel="nofollow">GoFundMe Giving Guarantee</a></p></div></div></li></ul></div></section></div><div><div class="collections_dark__sh9ba campaign-page_collections__ZmRpO hrt-mt-0" data-tracking-namespace="discover component"><div class="hrt-container collections_container__KVJc_"><h2 class="collections_introText__CXqBN">More ways to make a difference. Find fundraisers inspired by what you care about.</h2><div><div class="selector-header_container__k4kmu"><button class="collection-selector_button__zBhnx hrt-button hrt-button--hierarchy-secondary hrt-button--layout-inline hrt-button--size-medium hrt-button--color